dialect protocol
protocol wfcbitmap.mutations
version 1
schema wfc.bitmap.mutations
start record
framing record

# Real op frame (`dsl::variants_binary::encode_tagged_op`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag varint`,
# then the kind's framework record body (`os_pack::encode_record_body`). Each record is one mutation kind at its
# wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, which the codec looks up by the kind's keyword.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag varint
record change-seed tag=0
field body bytes
record resize-input tag=1
field body bytes
record set-input-pixels tag=2
field body bytes
record add-palette-color tag=3
field body bytes
record change-palette-color tag=4
field body bytes
record remove-palette-color tag=5
field body bytes
record resize-output tag=6
field body bytes
record change-model tag=7
field body bytes
record pin-pixel tag=8
field body bytes
record unpin-pixel tag=9
field body bytes
